# Headers applied by Cloudflare Pages to every response from this site.
# Referrer-Policy and X-Content-Type-Options already come from Cloudflare, so
# they are not repeated here to avoid sending each header twice.
#
# This page runs AdSense. Ad creatives are fetched from domains that are not
# known in advance, so a resource-level CSP here would either break the ads or
# have to allow so much (img-src *, frame-src across Google's ad network) that
# it would protect nothing. So the policy is limited to the directives that
# cost nothing and still help:
#   frame-ancestors -> nobody can put this page inside an iframe (clickjacking)
#   base-uri        -> no injected <base> can repoint every relative URL
#   form-action     -> a form cannot post to another origin
#   object-src      -> no <object>/<embed> plugins
# Loading of scripts and styles is left open on purpose; the protection for
# that layer is the integrity attribute (SRI) on each tag, still missing here.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
